<noinclude>
This template can be used to add in-line icons to text, alongside a default name for them.

*1 = Code needed to select the icon to be added
*Bold=y parameter can be set to Y to add bold letters to the icon words.
*Icon rendering defaults are handled by Template:Icon2Row.

The options are:

{| class="wikitable" 
|-
! Code
! Image
! Default text
|-
| hi
| [[File:Sk_hide.png|20x20px|link=]]
| Hide
|-
| ms
| [[File:Sk_movsilent.png|20x20px|link=]]
| Move Silently
|-
| pe
| [[File:Sk_perform.png|20x20px|link=]]
| Perform
|-
| shp
| [[File:Fe_esfhide.png|20x20px|link=]]
| Shadow Points
|}</noinclude>
<includeonly>{{
#ifeq:{{lcfirst:{{{bold|n}}}}}|y|'''}}{{
#switch:{{lc:{{{icon|{{{1|}}}}}}}}
<!-- Skill icons -->
| hi = {{Icon2Row|Sk_hide.png|Hide}}
| ms = {{Icon2Row|Sk_movsilent.png|Move Silently}}
| pe = {{Icon2Row|Sk_perform.png|Perform}}
<!-- Class Features -->
| shp = {{Icon2Row|Fe_esfhide.png|[[Shadowdancer|Shadow Points]]}}
<!-- Default -->
| #default = Code not found!
}}{{#ifeq:{{lcfirst:{{{bold|n}}}}}|y|'''}}</includeonly><noinclude></noinclude>
